Coil 3 rule strategy follows Coil's ProGuard guidance:
https://github.com/coil-kt/coil/blob/3.3.0/docs/faq.md
Coil is Copyright Coil Contributors, Apache-2.0.
This project additionally preserves service interface names for obfuscation.

OkHttp 4 optional-provider and resource-name rule strategy follows okhttp3.pro:
https://github.com/square/okhttp/blob/parent-4.12.0/okhttp/src/main/resources/META-INF/proguard/okhttp3.pro
OkHttp is Copyright Square, Inc., Apache-2.0.

Okio multifile facade optimization workaround was reproduced in the Release
sample, with the related ProGuard issue as background:
https://github.com/Guardsquare/proguard/issues/533

Retrofit 3 rules are adapted from its packaged retrofit2.pro (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/square/retrofit/blob/3.0.0/retrofit/src/main/resources/META-INF/proguard/retrofit2.pro
Copyright Square / Block, Inc.

Kotlinx serialization rules are adapted from its packaged common rules
(Apache-2.0), with a tested ProGuard enclosing-class companion match:
https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.serialization/tree/v1.11.0/core
Copyright JetBrains s.r.o. and contributors.

The additional SLF4J, Logback, JNA, D-Bus Java, SQLite JDBC and Llamatik
fragments are original rules based on their versioned source artifacts and
runtime reflection/JNI contracts. Upstream source references are recorded
per dependency in src/main/resources/keepkit/catalog.json.
These libraries are fixture dependencies, not plugin runtime dependencies.

Coroutines rules are adapted from kotlinx-coroutines-core-jvm 1.11.0 packaged
META-INF/proguard/coroutines.pro (Apache-2.0, JetBrains and contributors), with
original Desktop SPI and narrowly scoped ProGuard 7.7.0 optimization protection.
https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.coroutines/tree/1.11.0

jsoup rules include its packaged optional RE2/J warning rule (MIT, Jonathan
Hedley and contributors), with original rules for compile-only JSpecify
annotations and Java 11 reflection/enum contracts.
https://github.com/jhy/jsoup/tree/jsoup-1.22.2

Runtime dependencies:
Apache Maven Artifact 3.9.9: Apache-2.0
Google Gson 2.11.0: Apache-2.0
Kotlin Standard Library 2.2.0: Apache-2.0
